cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Tool-Observation Sensitivity in Language-Model Agents: A Fixed-Prefix Causal Study"
abstract: >-
  Pre-confirmatory research software for a fixed-prefix causal study of how the
  content of a real tool observation changes a language-model agent's next
  decision, and how quickly the agent recovers over four steps. The repository
  contains the CTO-800 harvest pipeline, perturbation renderer, calibration and
  main-run harnesses, analysis code, and governance documents. No confirmatory
  results are reported in version 0.1.0; the pilot is N=60 and is a screening
  signal, not a dose-response law.
